---
description: Kyrgyz full male name: given name followed by the family name. Note that the result is TWO words for a -ов surname and THREE for the native patronymic (Азамат Бакыт уулу), because уулу is a separate word.
generator: tdc
locale: ky
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="ky.person.male.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="ky.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
